"每秒伤害","values":[766,841],"baseValues":[765.7650000000001,840.8400000000003],"grows":true},{"name":"火属性攻击","values":[292,320],"baseValues":[291.72,320.32000000000005],"grows":true},{"name":"暴击率","values":[5,5],"unit":"%"},{"name":"防御","values":[15,17],"baseValues":[15.096000000000002,16.576000000000004],"grows":true}],"growthRate":1.02,"mainOptions":[{"name":"防御","min":10.0,"max":22.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"生命","min":8.0,"max":20.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"技能伤害值","min":6.0,"max":18.0,"unit":"%"}],"subOptions":[{"name":"武器技能恢复速度","min":5.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"}],"subCount":[0,1],"limitBreak":[{"name":"攻击","min":10.0,"max":10.0,"unit":"%"}],"engrave":[{"name":"攻击","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"生命","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"}],"engraveRandom":[{"name":"攻击","unit":"%","values":[3.0,6.0,9.0,12.0,15.0]}],"effects":[{"name":"专属效果","description":"命中目标时，对目标敌人造成流血效果，按照每秒伤害的120%对其造成重伤。该技能每4秒启动1次。"}],"skill":{"name":"粉碎","description":"大幅度挥舞斧头，对敌人造成近程伤害并附带重伤效果。","levels":[1,5],"damage":[180.0,220.0],"cooldown":[9.2,8.0],"ailment":"重伤"}}],"number":1}],"profile":{"Age":null,"Height":null,"Weight":null},"tribes":["人类"],"story":"战士休塔尔克，在芙莉莲一行中担任前卫。\n\n休塔尔克出生于曾经的战士之村，但是魔族的袭击摧毁了他的家园，休塔尔克也成为了孤儿。后来，他被战士艾泽收养，成为了艾泽的首席弟子。\n\n某天在修行时，休塔尔克因不想与魔物战斗而与艾泽发生争吵，最终被艾泽打了一拳。这件事让他受到很大的打击，离开了师父身边。\n\n后来，休塔尔克造访了利凯尔峡谷附近的一个村庄。当时村庄遭到了红镜龙的袭击，休塔尔克挺身而出赶走了红镜龙，成为了村庄的英雄。休塔尔克原本是个连自己都承认的心地善良的胆小鬼，在与芙莉莲初次见面时，因害怕红镜龙，他吓得哭着求助。然而，当休塔尔克下定决心战斗，在面对强敌时，虽然双手和师父一样颤抖，但他还是用自己的力量击败了红镜龙。从此，便与芙莉莲一起踏上了旅程。\n\n休塔尔克之所以与芙莉莲同行，是为了报答师父艾泽的恩情。由于艾泽的年纪已经不再适合长途旅行，休塔尔克的心愿是在他去世之前，给他带回满满的有趣旅行经历作为礼物。","storyKey":"profile_stark_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=629","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=629","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"],"voiceAudio":"gtaudio/data/offline-package.json; CharacterVoiceType; heroes.json VoiceId"},"voiceLines":[{"id":"stark","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["这将成为一个很好的故事，可以与我的师父分享。"],"enUS":["This will make a great story to share with my master."],"jaJP":["師匠へのいい土産話ができたよ。"]},"keys":["cv_stark_NormalBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/629/6290001"]},"audioName":"6290001"},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["是我…做到的吗？"],"enUS":["Did I… do it?"],"jaJP":["俺が…やったのか。"]},"keys":["cv_stark_BossBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/629/6290002"]},"audioName":"6290002"},{"type":"Die","label":"阵亡","texts":{"zhCN":["这是什么，也太过分了吧。"],"enUS":["Wait, this isn’t fair at all."],"jaJP":["なんだよ、無茶苦茶じゃねぇか。"]},"keys":["cv_stark_Die"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/629/6290003"]},"audioName":"6290003"},{"type":"GetExp","label":"获得经验结晶","texts":{"zhCN":["感觉自己变强了…！"],"enUS":["I feel like I’ve gotten stronger…!"],"jaJP":["強くなった気がする…！"]},"keys":["cv_stark_GetExp"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/629/6290004"]},"audioName":"6290004"},{"type":"LevelUp","label":"升级","texts":{"zhCN":["师父也一定走过这条路吧。"],"enUS":["My master must’ve walked this path too."],"jaJP":["師匠もこの道を辿ったんだな。"]},"keys":["cv_stark_LevelUp"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/629/6290005"]},"audioName":"6290005"},{"type":"EquipWeapon","label":"佩戴装备","texts":{"zhCN":["哦，这样的话应该可以随心所欲地行动了！"],"enUS":["Whoa, with this, I should be able to move however I like!"],"jaJP":["おお、これなら思いっきり動けそうだ。"]},"keys":["cv_stark_EquipWeapon"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/629/6290006"]},"audioName":"6290006"},{"type":"EquipCostume","label":"穿戴时装","texts":{"zhCN":["看起来适合我吗？"],"enUS":["Does it look good on me?"],"jaJP":["似合ってる？"]},"keys":["cv_stark_EquipCostume"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/629/6290007"]},"audioName":"62